msgid "Github Markdown filter"
msgstr "Github Markdown 过滤器"

msgid "Allows content to be submitted using Markdown, a simple plain-text syntax that is transformed into valid HTML."
msgstr "允许使用 Markdown 提交内容，这是一个简单的纯文本语法，可转换为有效的 HTML。"

msgid "Input filters"
msgstr "输入过滤器"

msgid "<p>The Markdown filter allows you to enter content using <a href=\"https://guides.github.com/features/mastering-markdown/\">Github Markdown</a>, a simple plain-text syntax that is transformed into valid HTML.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Markdown 过滤器允许您使用 <a href=\"https://guides.github.com/features/mastering-markdown/\">Github Markdown</a> 输入内容，这是转换为有效 HTML 的简单纯文本语法。</p>"

msgid "Markdown filter tips"
msgstr "Markdown 过滤器提示"

msgid ""
"\n"
"## Header 2 ##\n"
"### Header 3 ###\n"
"#### Header 4 ####\n"
"##### Header 5 #####\n"
"(Hashes on right are optional)\n"
"\n"
"Link [Drupal](http://drupal.org)\n"
"\n"
"Inline markup like _italics_,\n"
" **bold**, and `code()`.\n"
"\n"
"> Blockquote. Like email replies\n"
">> And, they can be nested\n"
"\n"
"* Bullet lists are easy too\n"
"- Another one\n"
"+ Another one\n"
"\n"
"1. A numbered list\n"
"2. Which is numbered\n"
"3. With periods and a space\n"
"\n"
"And now some code:\n"
"    // Code is indented text\n"
"    is_easy() to_remember();"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"## 标题 2 ##\n"
"### 标题 3 ###\n"
"#### 标题 4 ####\n"
"##### 标题 5 #####\n"
"（右侧的散列是可选的）\n"
"\n"
"链接[Drupal](http://drupal.org)\n"
"\n"
"内联标记，例如 _italics_、\n"
"**bold** 和 `code()`。\n"
"\n"
"> 块引用。 类似于电子邮件回复\n"
">> 并且，它们可以进行嵌套\n"
"\n"
"* 项目符号列表也很容易\n"
"- 另一个\n"
"+ 另一个\n"
"\n"
"1. 编号列表\n"
"2. 带有编号\n"
"3. 带有句点和空格\n"
"\n"
"这里提供了一些代码：\n"
"    // Code is indented text\n"
"    is_easy() to_remember();"

msgid ""
"Quick Tips:<ul>\n"
"      <li>Two or more spaces at a line's end = Line break</li>\n"
"      <li>Double returns = Paragraph</li>\n"
"      <li>*Single asterisks* or _single underscores_ = <em>Emphasis</em></li>\n"
"      <li>**Double** or __double__ = <strong>Strong</strong></li>\n"
"      <li>This is [a link](http://the.link.example.com \"The optional title text\")</li>\n"
"      </ul>For complete details on the Markdown syntax, see the <a href=\"http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/syntax\">Markdown documentation</a> and <a href=\"http://michelf.com/projects/php-markdown/extra/\">Markdown Extra documentation</a> for tables, footnotes, and more."
msgstr ""
"快速提示：<ul>\n"
"      <li>行尾的两个或更多个空格 = 换行符</li>\n"
"      <li>双回车符 = 段落</li>\n"
"      <li>*单星号* 或 _单下划线_ = <em>强调</em></li>\n"
"      <li>**双星号** or __双下划线__ = <strong>加粗</strong></li>\n"
"      <li>这是[一个链接](http://the.link.example.com \"可选标题文本\")</li>\n"
"      </ul>有关 Markdown 语法的完整详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/syntax\">Markdown 文档</a>和 <a href=\"http://michelf.com/projects/php-markdown/extra/\">Markdown Extra 文档</a>以了解表格和脚注等"

msgid "You can use <a href=\"@filter_tips\">Markdown syntax</a> to format and style the text. Also see <a href=\"@markdown_extra\">Markdown Extra</a> for tables, footnotes, and more."
msgstr "您可以使用 <a href=\"@filter_tips\">Markdown 语法</a>来格式化和样式化文本。 另请参阅 <a href=\"@markdown_extra\">Markdown Extra</a> 以了解表格和脚注等。"

msgid "Markdown"
msgstr "Markdown"

msgid "Allows content to be submitted using Github Markdown, a simple plain-text syntax that is filtered into valid HTML."
msgstr "允许使用 Github Markdown 提交内容，这是一个简单的纯文本语法，可过滤为有效的 HTML。"

